WEBVTT

00:00.520 --> 00:02.040
I've been here for a year now.

00:02.740 --> 00:04.000
How do you like it here in

00:04.000 --> 00:07.000
FF? FF has been the home that

00:07.000 --> 00:08.340
I was hoping for when I moved

00:08.340 --> 00:11.440
to Bangalore. I really love it with

00:11.440 --> 00:13.280
my friends who are like family here

00:13.280 --> 00:13.440
now.

